### Criar uma Turma
POST http://localhost:3000/turmas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ano": 2026,
  "disciplinaId": 2
}

### Listar todas as Turmas
GET http://localhost:3000/turmas

### Buscar Turma por ID
GET http://localhost:3000/turmas/1

### Atualizar Turma
PATCH http://localhost:3000/turmas/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ano": 2026
}

### Deletar Turma
DELETE http://localhost:3000/turmas/1
